<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang={DemoWeb.Locale.current()} data-loading>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="csrf-token" content={get_csrf_token()} />
    <.live_title default="Demo" suffix=" · ash_data_table demo">
      {assigns[:page_title]}
    </.live_title>
    <link phx-track-static rel="stylesheet" href={~p"/assets/css/app.css"} />
    <script defer phx-track-static type="text/javascript" src={~p"/assets/js/app.js"}>
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%!--
      The header lives in the root layout, so it is on every page, including
      the LiveViews a library mounts. So does the main landmark: a table
      mounted with `layout: false` is rendered straight into this layout and
      brings no landmark of its own.

      The links navigate live: all the pages they lead to are in one
      live_session, so a click swaps the LiveView and keeps the page and its
      socket (a full page load cuts the socket while the old page is still
      shown, and the connection toasts flash). This layout is rendered once
      and not again on live navigation: nothing in it may depend on the
      path. The two switchers are given the path of the first page as a
      fallback and take the current address when they are submitted
      (`Layouts.actor_switcher`); switching is a full page load.
    --%>
    <header class="navbar gap-4 border-b border-base-300 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <nav aria-label="Main" class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <.link navigate={~p"/"} class="font-semibold">ash_data_table demo</.link>
          <.link navigate={~p"/tasks"}>Tasks</.link>
          <.link navigate={~p"/deadlines"}>Deadlines</.link>
          <.link navigate={~p"/projects"}>Projects</.link>
          <.link navigate={~p"/comments"}>Comments</.link>
          <.link navigate={~p"/labels"}>Labels</.link>
          <.link navigate={~p"/specimens"}>Specimens</.link>
          <.link navigate={~p"/dashboard"}>Dashboard</.link>
          <.link navigate={~p"/named"}>Named tables</.link>
          <.link navigate={~p"/tasks/planner"}>Sprint planner</.link>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <Layouts.actor_switcher
        current_user={assigns[:current_user]}
        return_to={assigns[:conn] && @conn.request_path}
      />
      <Layouts.locale_switcher return_to={assigns[:conn] && @conn.request_path} />
      <Layouts.theme_toggle />
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      {@inner_content}
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
